			"Message": "chore(deps): Update dependencies and adjust rustfmt configuration\n\n- Added the `dynamic-acl` feature to the `tauri` dependency.\n- Updated `thiserror` from version `2.0.17` to `2.0.18`.\n- Corrected formatting in `tonic-prost` dependency entry by removing extra whitespace.\n- Modified `rustfmt.toml` to disable `remove_nested_parens`, `reorder_impl_items`, `reorder_imports`, and `reorder_modules` to align with updated code style preferences.",
